{
  "name": "@mcsr/shared",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "MCSR Helper's shared contract: types, constants, zod schemas, i18n dictionaries and the seed / ranked / tracking domain logic.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "MCSR Helper contributors",
  "//publish": [
    "⚠️★ `private: true` 在这个包上**尤其重要**（不要为了发布去掉它）：",
    "   下面 exports 指向的全是 **.ts 源文件**（本仓刻意不给 shared 加 build 步骤 ——",
    "    前端走 Vite 别名、后端走 esbuild，两边都能直接吃源码，少一份可能漂移的产物）。",
    "   于是发到 npm 的话，别人装到的是 TypeScript 源码：要么自己配编译，要么直接报错。",
    "   要用这些类型/逻辑，clone 仓库（CONTRIBUTING.md），不要 `pnpm add @mcsr/shared`。",
    "⚠️ repository/homepage/bugs 指向的是 GitHub 上的 Andy-ac/mcsr-helper；改名的话六份 package.json 要一起改。"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Andy-ac/mcsr-helper.git",
    "directory": "packages/shared"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Andy-ac/mcsr-helper#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Andy-ac/mcsr-helper/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.ts",
    "./i18n": "./src/i18n/index.ts",
    "./seed": "./src/seed.ts",
    "./seedPicker": "./src/seedPicker.ts",
    "./fileUpdates": "./src/fileUpdates.ts",
    "./resources": "./src/resources.ts",
    "./auth": "./src/auth.ts",
    "./permissions": "./src/permissions.ts",
    "./desktop": "./src/desktop.ts",
    "./review": "./src/review.ts",
    "./calendar": "./src/calendar.ts",
    "./calendar-time": "./src/calendar-time.ts",
    "./videos": "./src/videos.ts",
    "./live": "./src/live.ts",
    "./ranked": "./src/ranked/index.ts",
    "./tracking": "./src/tracking.ts",
    "./modCatalog": "./src/modCatalog.ts",
    "./modFolders": "./src/modFolders.ts",
    "./fabricMeta": "./src/fabricMeta.ts"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "zod": "^4.6.2"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  }
}
